  <ferc:TypeOfOrganizationIfNotIncorporated id="Tag1003" contextRef="C1">Sierrita Gas Pipeline LLC was organized as a Delaware limited liability company on January 10, 2013.</ferc:TypeOfOrganizationIfNotIncorporated>
  <ferc:GeneralInformationAboutStatesInWhichRespondentServicesWereRendered id="Tag1004" contextRef="C1">Respondent is engaged in open-access transportation of natural gas. Respondent's system commences at an interconnection with the pipeline facilities of El Paso Natural Gas Company, L.L.C. near Tucson, Arizona and extends to a southern terminus at an interconnection at the international border between the United States and Mexico, near Sasabe, Arizona. Respondent delivers all of its natural gas into Mexico.</ferc:GeneralInformationAboutStatesInWhichRespondentServicesWereRendered>
