&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify;"&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;(1) Settlements of these amounts are made within equity and are considered non-cash financing activities.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 16pt;"&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: Arial; -aw-import: ignore;"&gt; &amp;#160;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: Arial; font-style: italic; -aw-import: ignore;"&gt; &amp;#160;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 16pt;"&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: Arial; font-style: italic;"&gt;Affiliate Balances and Activities&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; font-size: 16pt;"&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: Arial; -aw-import: ignore;"&gt; &amp;#160;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; font-size: 16pt;"&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;We have an Operation and Maintenance Agreement (OMA) with Kinder Morgan NatGas O&amp;amp;M, LLC (KMN), an indirect subsidiary of KMI. Pursuant to the OMA, KMN assumes the responsibility of operating and maintaining our facilities including subsequent capital additions and modifications to our facilities, as well as providing certain other commercial, administrative, and other functions as identified in the OMA. KMN bills us for direct costs, indirect costs, and allocated general and administrative costs.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; font-size: 16pt;"&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: Arial; -aw-import: ignore;"&gt; &amp;#160;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; font-size: 16pt;"&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;We do not have employees. Employees of KMI provide services to us. In accordance with the OMA, we reimburse KMI at cost.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 16pt;"&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: Arial; -aw-import: ignore;"&gt; &amp;#160;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
